{
  "id": "58",
  "title": "造微论",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“造微论”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "两仪肇闢，六甲攸生，将三元而作三才，建四时而为四柱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-1e38814d6bbb8064f3ab-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "干为禄本，定一生职位高低。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-ebe4ebec4fe8619a3bc2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "支作命基，佈三限寿元终始。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-c7138f444238344573ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年生为根；月建为苗；日管经营，断中年之休咎；时为结果，定晚岁之荣枯。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-be6bf5145a8c7832f5d7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "先推胎息之由，次入变通之化。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-413581639e33521ec38e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "为官为贵，缘上下以咸和。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-6263120d89f80d724aec-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "多滞多危，本根元而相剋。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-d5772ea2f846cfd950f8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是故，格清局正，当为臺阁之臣；印旺官生，必作钧衡之任。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-bef80bfc9aea88ab418a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "马头带剑，镇压边疆。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-fbc722a280f33488cc3a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬逢华（华盖），尊居翰苑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-79a32e600df8c75a7e73-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄虽多而有害，福不为祥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-3ca53437796753477335-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀虽重而无伤，刑当不祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-5ad226fa68ef42f74bd7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三奇忽遇，才高立解成名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-ee864f24708c89dd4fa0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六合正逢，家富又能增业。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-792df4ea5a3a11d84f79-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "空亡亲于寡宿，孤独躘踵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-b617f834974460b8a434-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "长生陷于空亡，贫寒偃蹇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-e33473a21ba1fc95a825-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "桃花若临帝座，因色亡身。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-cc515456b444affedc87-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "咸池更会日宫，缘妻致富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-0a4f265f35cc6b78ab34-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "根源浅薄，逢生旺而不荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-2628f5a3162816eceb80-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "本主兴荣，遇休囚而反吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-04d43b0b40257388f21e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃临于五鬼，定须重配流徒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-8ef1172e9cc3f1722e59-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "勾绞叠于三刑，应是频遭编配。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-2ab5097079076ab41291-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是以，登仕途者，莫逢吞陷，爵禄亏停；当兵权者，勿遇天中，身权退失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-097b2037ad87b9111f5a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "胸襟澄澈，盖因水济江湖。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-7429834835343fd6333a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "学问渊源，本是水居壬癸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-ccda70cbc8b747e2b6dd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "慈祥愷悌，木乘甲乙之乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-f23a260518eec8440929-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "眊燥炎阳，火盛丙丁之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-65313976f2daf28836b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "名高禄重，乾金早会庚辛。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-8c056ca7b0b6fb894ab8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贯朽粟陈，镇土重亲戊己。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-0ee10abefb4127fa10de-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木繁而无金断削，纵荣而末岁孤穷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-e7dc02e8c4130e1d3d26-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火炎而无水淘溶，纵发而早年夭折。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-dfd3603e50b448aac4b0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "粤若，水之浮泛，惟凭土以隄防；土重而无木疏通，遂归愚浊；金坚而无火煆炼，终是兇顽。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-5321d8cd5dcd48074174-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "至若，金脆火炎，多则损己；木柔金重，利则伤身。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-70461535298a12e4724b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水清而不假土多，土弱而不禁木盛，火强燥而微吵，水略济以宽和；须将匀配为佳，亦以均调为上。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-b849bc28ec3bceef2a2f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大显者，贵守深隐。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-2fe5182d85e58907747a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "大屈者，贵守卑伸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-a9368953f64a784b19fc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "寿极年高，皆是禄临帝旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-1bbcc2dff652b36f476d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "职崇位显，为缘马会官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-05a4f87cf3dd3a811263-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "华盖逢空，偏宜僧道。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-d99fd00b0061f2ca6a97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "学堂遇贵，惟利师儒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-c77f25f7293636f2883e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行若也萧索，五命因而低弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-11ae745a97741e01d60c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日逢空（空亡）寡（寡宿），其妻多致生离。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-c2973e50f89b1279d3f4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时值孤虚，其子多饶不肖。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-3c7b81d88490f2e5871b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "绝宫为鼓盆之杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-b4b017580fb51af67817-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "胎宫为白虎之神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-6ed54f4b184fdcef879b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天空临嗣息之宫，末岁损成家之子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-ebc56d4e3d0322e5fe20-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "运逢吉宿无木主，则未足欢娱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-bd1001839c6b99ff77ff-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "限守凶神有根苗，则不须畏惧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-4500de200293f7657a94-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁君若临恶曜，一岁迍邅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-b4b2969577b661b8cd5b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生时若值休囚，一生愁叹。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-d80ff624e9deddf3e7a9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "源清者，其流必远。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-efc47b4603e2cb9196ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "本浊者，所作无成。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-f1b7e97c45d912b64ca3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "八字超群，不贵则当大富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-68fec978cf8fa0a1e76a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行驳杂，居安可不虑危。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-5b6e447aa3f0fb558033-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "休囚者，身性卑微。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-9e54812764aceefbd684-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "旺相者，名位壮实。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-94454fa169e12ef63040-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "先强后弱，必先吉而后凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-1b49853d0f2f6c4417ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "始弱终强，亦始凶而终吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-237e49d64f0d2760dedd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若乃运限所临之地，凭流年星辰凶吉，以定祸福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "58-944aff642f72ed232586-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
